STS-Oct-M77-Gale	43-70	71-267	A bit of searching ( of memory , and of texts ) revealed the following from the Jan ' 93 issue of the _American Jl. of Physics_ .	" What follows is a tale of physicists entangled among philosophical snares , scientists attempting to discover that well - disguised trail they thought most likely to lead to the goal sought by all , namely , good , solid science . We relate this tale in philosophical terms , from the point of view of the philosopher , since that , after all , is indeed our perspective . Yet , even though the terms and identifications might seem alien to today 's students of the physicist 's art , there most probably exists none the less some rude edification for them to encounter along the way . For , no matter the philosopher 's penchant to deploy and exploit ancient taxonomies and arcane systems of categories , in the end it is physics and physicists which recognizably serve as targets of the philosophical exercise , and its is the activities of these targets which contain the message modulating the medium . In any case , in the end it is perhaps useful and exhilarating to see one 's life pinned - down , laid out , exposed in someone else 's dissecting pan . "	A bit of searching ( of memory , and of texts ) revealed the following from the Jan ' 93 issue of the _American Jl. of Physics_ .	" What follows is a tale of physicists entangled among philosophical snares , scientists attempting to discover that well - disguised trail they thought most likely to lead to the goal sought by all , namely , good , solid science . We relate this tale in philosophical terms , from the point of view of the philosopher , since that , after all , is indeed our perspective . Yet , even though the terms and identifications might seem alien to today's students of the physicist's art , there most probably exists none the less some rude edification for them to encounter along the way . For , no matter the philosopher's penchant to deploy and exp